  "name": "fixture/PMC12180358-correction-notice.xml",
  "xml": "<!DOCTYPE article\nPUBLIC \"-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD with MathML3 v1.3 20210610//EN\" \"JATS-archivearticle1-3-mathml3.dtd\">\n<article xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" dtd-version=\"1.3\" xml:lang=\"en\" article-type=\"correction\"><?properties open_access?><processing-meta base-tagset=\"archiving\" mathml-version=\"3.0\" table-model=\"xhtml\" tagset-family=\"jats\"><restricted-by>pmc</restricted-by></processing-meta><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type=\"nlm-ta\">Curr Neuropharmacol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type=\"iso-abbrev\">Curr Neuropharmacol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type=\"publisher-id\">CN</journal-id><journal-title-group><journal-title>Current Neuropharmacology</journal-title></journal-title-group><issn pub-type=\"ppub\">1570-159X</issn><issn pub-type=\"epub\">1875-6190</issn><publisher><publisher-name>Bentham Science Publishers</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta>\n<article-meta><article-id pub-id-type=\"pmc\">PMC12180358</article-id><article-id pub-id-type=\"publisher-id\">CN-23-8-1007</article-id><article-id pub-id-type=\"doi\">10.2174/1570159X2308250310122913</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type=\"heading\"><subject>Medicine, Neurology, Pharmacology, Neuroscience</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Corrigendum to: &#x0201c;Dietary Intervention with Omega-3 Fatty Acids Mitigates Maternal High-Fat Diet-Induced Behavioral and Myelin-Related Alterations in Adult Offspring&#x0201d;</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type=\"author\"><name><surname>Jastrz&#x00119;bska</surname><given-names>Joanna</given-names></name><xref rid=\"aff1\" ref-type=\"aff\">1</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type=\"author\"><name><surname>Frankowska</surname><given-names>Ma&#x00142;gorzata</given-names></name><xref rid=\"aff1\" ref-type=\"aff\">1</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type=\"author\"><name><surname>Weso&#x00142;owska</surname><given-names>Julita</given-names></name><xref rid=\"aff2\" ref-type=\"aff\">2</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type=\"author\"><name><surname>Filip</surname><given-names>Ma&#x00142;gorzata</given-names></name><xref rid=\"aff1\" ref-type=\"aff\">1</xref></contrib><contrib contrib-type=\"author\"><name><surname>Smaga</surname><given-names>Irena</given-names></name><xref rid=\"aff1\" ref-type=\"aff\">1</xref></contrib><aff id=\"aff1\">\n<label>1</label>\n<institution content-type=\"dept\">Department of Drug Addiction Pharmacology</institution>, <institution>Maj Institute of Pharmacology Polish Academy of Sciences</institution>, <addr-line>12 Sm&#x00119;tna Street</addr-line>, <addr-line><postal-code>31-343</postal-code><city> Krak&#x000f3;w</city></addr-line>, <country country=\"pl\">Poland</country>; </aff><aff id=\"aff2\">\n<label>2</label>\n<institution content-type=\"dept\">Laboratory of Microscopic Imaging, Maj Institute of Pharmacology Polish Academy of Sciences</institution>, <institution>CEPHARES</institution>, <addr-line>12 Sm&#x00119;tna Street</addr-line>, <addr-line><postal-code>31-343</postal-code><city> Krak&#x000f3;w</city></addr-line>, <country country=\"pl\">Poland</country></aff></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type=\"epub\"><day>10</day><month>3</month><year>2025</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type=\"ppub\"><year>2025</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type=\"pmc-release\"><day>10</day><month>3</month><year>2025</year></pub-date><!--PMC Release delay is 0 months and 0 days and was based on the <pub-date pub-type=\"epub\"/>.--><volume>23</volume><issue>8</issue><fpage>1007</fpage><lpage>1007</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>&#x000a9; 2025 The Author(s). Published by Bentham Science Publisher.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2025</copyright-year><copyright-holder>The Author(s)</copyright-holder><license><ali:license_ref xmlns:ali=\"http://www.niso.org/schemas/ali/1.0/\" specific-use=\"textmining\" content-type=\"ccbylicense\">https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/</ali:license_ref><license-p>This is an open access article published under CC BY 4.0 <uri xlink:href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode</uri></license-p></license></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>In the original article titled &#x0201c;<related-article related-article-type=\"corrected-article\" ext-link-type=\"doi\" id=\"CN-23-3-329\" xlink:href=\"10.2174/1570159X23666241014164940\" vol=\"23\" page=\"329-348\"><article-title>\nDietary Intervention with Omega-3 Fatty Acids Mitigates Maternal High-Fat Diet-Induced Behavioral and Myelin-Related Alterations in Adult Offspring</article-title></related-article>&#x0201d;, published in Current Neuropharmacology, 2025, Vol. 23(3), pp. 329-348, an error was noted in Figure <bold>7</bold>). Specifically, a label was missing. The corrected version of Figure <bold>7</bold>) is provided below, with the missing text &#x0201c;<bold>cingulate</bold>&#x0201d; now included.</p><p>The correct version of Fig <bold>7</bold> is given below.</p><p>The original article can be accessed online at: <ext-link xlink:href=\"https://www.eurekaselect.com/article/143855\" ext-link-type=\"uri\">https://www.eurekaselect.com/article/143855</ext-link>.</p><p>We regret this oversight and apologize to our readers for any inconvenience caused.</p><p>Details of the error and correction are provided below.</p><p>\n<bold>Original Figure 7:</bold>\n</p><p>\n<inline-graphic xlink:href=\"CN-23-8-1007_F1.jpg\"/>\n</p><p>\n<bold>Corrected Figure 7:</bold>\n</p><p>\n<inline-graphic xlink:href=\"CN-23-8-1007_F2.jpg\"/>\n</p></body><back><ref-list><title>REFERENCE</title><ref id=\"r1\"><label>1</label><element-citation publication-type=\"journal\"><person-group person-group-type=\"author\">\n<name><surname>Joanna</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name>\n<name><surname>Ma&#x00142;gorzata</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name>\n<name><surname>Julita</surname><given-names>W.</given-names></name>\n<name><surname>Ma&#x00142;gorzata</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name>\n<name><surname>Irena</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name>\n</person-group><article-title>Dietary intervention with omega-3 fatty acids mitigates maternal high-fat diet-induced behavioral and myelin-related alterations in adult offspring.</article-title><source>Curr. Neuropharmacol.</source><year>2025</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>348</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type=\"pmid\">39492773</pub-id>\n</element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>"
 },
